{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Such as has never been.</b> In a night such as this there has never been such a cry, for no night was one of enemy forces engaging in battle — for then the cry in the city does indeed multiply, as in קוֹל צְעָקָה מִשַּׁעַר הַדָּגִים, וִילָלָה מִן הַמִּשְׁנֶה, וְשֶׁבֶר גָּדוֹל מֵהַגְּבָעוֹת (Zephaniah 1:10) — but on a night such as this, which was a night of peace in Egypt, there has never been, <b>nor will there again be</b>, such a cry."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:07.185188402Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}